<title>USA: Sysco Corp Q1 shr rises to $0.41.</title>
<headline>Sysco Corp Q1 shr rises to $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.41		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			 73,407		   66,171</p>
<p> Sales		  3,679,223		3,291,910</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 180,048		  182,792</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: At the end of the first quarter the company had bought 4.2 million common shares under 6-million-share buyback program authorized for 1996, and average shares outstanding for the quarter were 1.5 percent less than in the first quarter of the prior year.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
